+The agent keeps observing, replanning, and retrying until verified success or a human
+stops it. There is no three-attempt limit, and `done(success=false)` does not end an
+episode. An operator can explicitly cap a run with `--max-steps N`; `0` is unlimited.
+Motion guards and hardware/model errors still apply; this does not automatically
+restart a crashed process or retry uncertain motion commands.
+
